      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 30,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Exporter:** [axsuul/plex-media-server-exporter](https://github.com/axsuul/plex-media-server-exporter) v2.1.0. Sparser than v1.x \u2014 no per-session bitrate, no library bandwidth, no transcode FPS. Available metrics: `plex_up`, `plex_info`, `plex_media_count{section,type}`, `plex_sessions_count{user,state}`, `plex_audio_transcode_sessions_count`, `plex_video_transcode_sessions_count`, `plex_media_downloads_count`.\n\n**For richer per-session metrics**, consider also deploying [Tautulli](https://tautulli.com/) \u2014 it has its own Prometheus exporter via `homers` and tracks per-stream bandwidth/quality/buffering."
      }
